# Licence signing key. Belongs outside the repo entirely (see
# config/licensing.php), but ignored here as well so an accidental copy into
# the working tree can never be committed. A leaked private key lets anyone
# mint licences for the product.
*.pem
!resources/licensing/public.pem
license-signing-key*
storage/app/license/
